Low-Mechanitor Exitum-ρ-15 is a servant of [[Org/Prime Meridian/index|Prime Meridian]] at the [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/Prime Meridian Sub Transit Nexus|Sub Transit Nexus]] in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/index|Sableclutch]]. He is wired like the rest of the Org's staff, with rods of dull metal set into his arm and throat, and he walks with a three-part gait where the other servitors have two. He speaks through the radio in a static that is hard to follow.

He works the loading bay, where he checks what visitors bring with a magnifying armature, a set of colored lenses set into a cavity in his forearm, and escorts those let in.
